<para>When <computeroutput>finalByte == &apos;q&apos;</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>length &gt; 0</computeroutput>, checks for the SKiT <computeroutput>END;</computeroutput> prefix first. If present delegates to <computeroutput><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_skit_1ad615d563dfc05d16336ee791d20b8819" kindref="member">handleSkitFilepath()</ref></computeroutput>. Otherwise runs <computeroutput><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_sixel_decoder" kindref="compound">SixelDecoder</ref></computeroutput>, fires <computeroutput>"imageDecoded"</computeroutput>, and sets <computeroutput><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_skit_1ad3b5fece4c7abc0f059b1f831da72feb" kindref="member">lastImageRows</ref></computeroutput> for the caller to advance the cursor.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>finalByte</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>DCS final byte stored by <computeroutput><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_video_1a92e80829c0ad42c69dc6f0982eebb892" kindref="member">Video::storeDCSHeader()</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
